sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Student
  participant W as Web app
  participant L as Lab
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant M as ML worker

  rect rgb(253, 244, 234)
    Note over S,D: Synchronous path, the learner waits
    S->>L: Exploit the target
    L-->>S: Flag
    S->>W: Submit flag
    W->>W: Check user, hash, score
    W->>D: Insert attempt, event
    W-->>S: Score breakdown
  end
  rect rgb(246, 246, 246)
    Note over W,M: Asynchronous path, planned
    M->>D: Read attempts, events
    M->>M: Risk, next challenge
    M->>D: Upsert predictions
    W->>D: Read predictions
  end
